Z||000004||Sage||11-10-2001||09:08 AM||||I really like stories like this.  your dad sounds like a cool dude!<P>Brings to mind several other "old, tired, overused cliches;<P>"Necessity is the mother of invention"<P>"He who is satisfied with what he's got, always has enough"<P>"There's no substitute for experience"<P>Glad to hear about you gettig your ride back on the road via "good old American know how" instead of the normal padding of someone else's pockets!<P>Good story, thanks for sharing.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
